]]></description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:49:28 +0000</pubDate><link>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50510042</link><dc:creator>snirgbs</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50510042</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50510042</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[Handwriting, as a Font]]></title><description><![CDATA[
